AN.'}{'symbol': 'SPG', 'date': '2020-08-11 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Simon Property Group CEO Says There Will Be Some Level Abatements And Collection Issues For The Rest Of 2020', 'text': 'SIMON PROPERTY GROUP -  TENANT BANKRUPTCIES AND LOWER SPECIALTY LEASING DURING Q2 DUE TO COVID-19 IMPACTED OCCUPANCY ABOUT 60 BASIS POINTS- CONF CALL.SIMON PROPERTY GROUP - CURRENTLY 91% OF TENANTS OR NEARLY 23,000 TENANTS ACROSS U.S. PORTFOLIO ARE OPEN AND OPERATING.SIMON PROPERTY GROUP - WE\'RE ALL OPEN, EXCEPT FOR THE 7 RECENT CLOSINGS IN CALIFORNIA- CEO.SIMON PROPERTY GROUP - SPARC GROUP\'S INVESTMENTS IN BROOKS BROTHERS AND LUCKY BRAND JEANS ARE EXPECTED TO GENERATE POSITIVE EBITDA AFTER INTEGRATION.SIMON PROPERTY GROUP - EXPECT ANY EQUITY INVESTMENTS BY SPARC TO BE RETURNED WITHIN A YEAR AFTER INTEGRATION OF OPERATIONS.SIMON PROPERTY GROUP CEO - BUYING INTO BROOKS BROTHERS AND LUCKY BECAUSE "WE THINK WE CAN MAKE MONEY".SIMON PROPERTY GROUP- CEO SAYS WILL NOT RESPOND TO MARKET RUMORS OR SPECULATION ON TALKS WITH AMAZON TO CONVERT VACANT STORES INTO FULFILLMENT CENTERS.SIMON PROPERTY GROUP CEO- WILL STILL DEAL WITH ISSUES GOING FORWARD, THERE\'LL BE SOME LEVEL ABATEMENTS AND COLLECTION ISSUES FOR THE REST OF 2020.'}{'symbol': 'SPG', 'date': '2020-08-11 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Simon Property Group Reports Q2 FFO Per Share $2.12', 'text': "GROUP REPORTS SECOND QUARTER 2020 RESULTS.Q2 FFO PER SHARE $2.12.GROUP INC - LOST NEARLY 10,500 SHOPPING DAYS IN U.S. PORTFOLIO IN Q2.GROUP INC - HAVE GENERALLY BEEN ENCOURAGED BY SHOPPER RESPONSE, PARTICULARLY IN CERTAIN LOCATIONS, AFTER RE-OPENING.GROUP INC - QTRLY FUNDS FROM OPERATIONS WERE $2.12 PER DILUTED SHARE.GROUP INC - AS OF AUGUST 7, 91% OF TENANTS ACROSS COMPANY'S U.S. RETAIL PROPERTIES WERE OPEN AND OPERATING.GROUP - MORE THAN HALF OF REMAINING UNOPENED TENANTS ARE CLOSED BECAUSE OF GOVERNMENTAL ORDERS LIMITING OR PROHIBITING THEIR OPERATIONS.GROUP INC - QTRLY U.S. MALLS AND PREMIUM OUTLETS OCCUPANCY WAS 92.9% AT JUNE 30, 2020.GROUP INC- QTRLY COMPARABLE PROPERTY NET OPERATING INCOME DECLINED 18.5% AND PORTFOLIO NOI DECLINED 21.0%."}{'symbol': 'SYY', 'date': '2020-08-11 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Sysco Reports Q4 Adj. Earnings Per Share $2.01', 'text': 'SYSCO REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2020 RESULTS.Q4 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $2.01.Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $-0.30 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.QTRLY SALES DECREASED 42.7% TO $8.9 BILLION.QTRLY LOSS PER SHARE $1.22.Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $-0.30 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}{'symbol': 'SYY', 'date': '2020-08-11 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Sysco Reports Qtrly Loss Per Share Of $1.22', 'text': 'Q4 ADJUSTED LOSS PER SHARE OF $0.29 .SYSCO REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2020 RESULTS.Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $-0.30 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.QTRLY SALES DECREASED 42.7% TO $8.9 BILLION.QTRLY LOSS PER SHARE $1.22.Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $-0.30 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}{'symbol': 'TWTR', 'date': '2020-08-11 15:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Twitter Says Giving Users More Control Over Who Replies To Their Tweets', 'text': 'TWITTER - GIVING USERS MORE CONTROL OVER WHO REPLIES TO THEIR TWEETS.TWITTER - BEFORE TWEETING, USERS CAN CHOOSE WHO CAN REPLY WITH 3 OPTIONS: TO EVERYONE, ONLY PEOPLE USERS FOLLOW, OR ONLY PEOPLE MENTIONED.TWITTER - USERS WHO CAN’T REPLY WILL STILL BE ABLE TO VIEW, RETWEET, RETWEET WITH COMMENT, SHARE, AND LIKE TWEETS.'}